# Outfit camera (R18): a cine camera, boxy body, long steel lens with a matte box, two accent film reels on top,
# steel handle and a glowing tally light.
name outfit_cinecam
grid 5
size 9 5 8
slot body Ink
slot lens Steel
slot reel SwatchAccent
slot tally SwatchGlow
box 0 0 0 6 5 4 body
beam 6 2.5 2 8 2.5 2 1.2 lens
box 8 1 0 9 4 4 body
carve box 8 2 1 9 3 3
ellipsoid 1.5 2.5 6 1.5 1 1.6 reel
ellipsoid 4.5 2.5 6 1.5 1 1.6 reel
box 2 2 4 4 3 5 lens
box 5 0 3 6 1 4 tally
pivot 3 2 0
